      "summary": "What does Intelligent Document Processing in Databricks actually look like in practice?\n\nIn Part 2, we're back with Sepi from Databricks to get hands-on with an end-to-end IDP demo, taking documents through AI Parse Document, AI Classify and AI Extract.\n\nSee how you can classify documents, extract the information you need, automate processing when files arrive, and turn previously unstructured content into data that can power downstream reporting and AI agents.\n\nRead more about our IDP Accelerator here: https://www.advancinganalytics.co.uk/intelligent-document-processing-accelerator",
